386565,qcad,1eeffc5daf5a06cf6213ffc19e95923cdebb2eb8,https://github.com/qcad/qcad,https://github.com/qcad/qcad/commit/1eeffc5daf5a06cf6213ffc19e95923cdebb2eb8,check vertexIndex which might be -1 for broken DXF,0,0,"We are given a C++ code snippet from a function `DL_Dxf::handleLWPolylineData`. We need to analyze it for security vulnerabilities.

