   - `qeh->qeh_tsu_buf`: the buffer for TSU
   - `&qeh->qeh_tsu_sz`: a pointer to the size of the TSU buffer (which will be updated by the function)

6. If `lsqpack_enc_init` returns a non-zero value, it logs an error and returns -1.

