   - `syslog`, `uselib`, `acct`, `modify_ldt`, `quotactl`, `add_key`, `keyctl`, `request_key`, `move_pages`, `mbind`, `get_mempolicy`, `set_mempolicy`, `migrate_pages`, `unshare`, `setns`, `mount`, `umount`, `umount2`, `pivot_root`, `clone`, `ioctl`, `clone3`, `open_tree`, `move_mount`, `fsopen`, `fsconfig`, `fsmount`, `fspick`, `mount_setattr`

