4. It gets `indexes` from `GetAuthenticIndexQueue(image)`.

5. It sets `packet_size` to `GetPSDPacketSize(image)`.

6. Then it enters a loop for `x` from 0 to `image->columns-1` (since `x < (ssize_t) image->columns`).

