Signed-off-by: Mathieu Poirier <mathieu.poirier@linaro.org>",1,1,"We are given a function `rpmsg_virtio_add_ctrl_dev` from a kernel module (likely Linux kernel) that sets up a virtio RPMSG (Remote Processor Message) control device.

